# Generated by generate-sbom. Not regenerated by any real build/CI step yet (that's
# implementation-plan.md phase 1.16) — ic-core's, the SDK's, and ic-email-to-downloads's own are
# committed anyway (phase 1.12c's SBOM/licenses screen needs real data to read, not nothing; §2's
# license-disclosure mandate applies to ic-email-to-downloads the same as any other package), kept
# current by hand via the root `generate-sbom:*` scripts until 1.16 automates it. Anything else
# matching this pattern (an ad-hoc test plugin's own, etc.) stays ignored.
*.cdx.json
